1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Surrender time to God, and time is life.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
I've been in this pulpit 35 minutes.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
I have lived 35 minutes in this pulpit.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:14,000
When you surrender time, you surrender life.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Let's bow our heads.

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Dear God, the carnal mind is the most deceitful thing in the universe.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,000
I'm desperately wicked.

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:34,000
And the first person it deceives is the person who has it.

9
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,000
No one can deceive your God.

10
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,000
You're the one who searched the heart and the mind.

11
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000
You know our thoughts before we think them.

12
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Father, I hope that those decisions that were made out loud were made with 100% seriousness.

13
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Let sons and daughters of yours, Father, come to the realization I need to get closer to God.

